# Copy to .env.local for local development. Never commit a filled-in copy.
#
# Where the lead form posts (multipart/form-data, contact details only, the
# public form never sends files). Simplest setup: a Formspree form URL, e.g.
#   VITE_LEAD_ENDPOINT=https://formspree.io/f/your-form-id
#
# While unset, the form validates normally but shows "online submission is
# not available yet" and points visitors at the direct contact details.
#
# Bills are collected separately through a SharePoint "Request files" link.
# See docs/backend-requirements.md.
VITE_LEAD_ENDPOINT=
